values ('a6b7c8d9-0e1f-4a03-8c33-3d4e5f6a7b03', 'applied-lessons-advanced', 'Applied Lessons (Advanced)', 'This course provides advanced private studio instruction focused on artistic maturity, technical refinement, repertoire development, interpretation, memorization, recital preparation, collaboration, recording, audition readiness, and pre-professional growth. Students develop a semester-long performance plan, document practice and self-evaluation, prepare advanced repertoire, collaborate with accompanists or ensemble partners, perform in studio-class and mock-audition settings, and assemble a portfolio that supports recitals, auditions, graduate study, or early professional opportunities.');

